{"question_id":"zKcbP9ChM4PrUU6F","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2015 Paper 1 Offline","year":2015,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"solid-state","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","type":"mcqm","marks":4,"negMarks":2,"content":"If the unit cell of a mineral has cubic close packed (ccp) array of oxygen atoms with m fraction of octahedral holes occupied by aluminium ions and n fraction of tetrahedral holes occupied by magnesium ions, m and n, respectively, are","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"1/2, 1/8"},{"identifier":"B","content":"1, 1/4"},{"identifier":"C","content":"1/2, 1/2"},{"identifier":"D","content":"1/4, 1/8"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p>For ccp, Z = 4 = no. of O-atoms</p>\n<p>No. of octahedral voids = 4</p>\n<p>No. of tetrahedral voids = 2 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 4 = 8</p>\n<p>No. of Al<sup>3+</sup> ions = m <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.76ex\" height=\"1.09ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -491 778 482\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> 4</p>\n<p>No. of Mg<sup>2+</sup> ions = n <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0.02ex